### Create no file asset
POST {{host}}/api/adm/v1/asset/licence/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Obrazok vtaka ohnivaka",
  "type": "image"
}

> {% client.global.set('assetId', response.body.id) %}

### Create assest with associated image file
POST {{host}}/api/adm/v1/image/asset/{{assetId}}/position/default
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
  "checksum": "123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set('imageId', response.body.id)
%}

### Upload chunk 1
POST {{host}}/api/adm/v1/image/{{imageId}}/chunk
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="filename.jpg"

< ../../tests/data/chunk/chunkaa

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk";
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offset": 0,
  "size": 262144
}

### Finish upload
PATCH {{host}}/api/adm/v1/image/{{imageId}}/uploaded
Content-Type: application/json

### GEt single asset
GET {{host}}/api/adm/v1/asset/{{assetId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/adm/v1/asset/search?offset=10&visible=true&described=false&withProcessedFile=true

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/adm/v1/asset/licence/1/search?type=image,audio&status=with_file,draft&order[createdAt]=desc

### Search by podcast
GET {{host}}/api/adm/v1/asset/licence/1/search?podcastIds=5edeb44d-c64b-4357-957d-688d9cf7e63a

### Search by podcast
GET {{host}}/api/adm/v1/asset/licence/1/search?inPodcast=true

